sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Cliente / Web UI
    participant API as API service
    participant Controller as StationTemperatureReportsController
    participant Service as GetCurrentTemperatureReportService
    participant StationRepo as IStationRepository / MongoWeatherStationRepository
    participant IngestionClient as ApiToIngestionCurrentWeatherClient
    participant Ingestion as Ingestion service
    participant OWM as ResilientWeatherDataProvider / OpenWeather

    Client->>API: GET /stations/:stationId/reports/temperature/current<br/>Authorization: Bearer JWT
    API->>Controller: route(stationId, user)
    Controller->>Service: execute(stationId)
    Service->>StationRepo: findById(stationId)
    StationRepo-->>Service: station

    alt Station is not provider=openweather
        Service-->>Controller: provider validation error
        Controller-->>Client: 422 station not backed by OpenWeather
    else Station can use OpenWeather
        Service->>IngestionClient: getCurrentWeather(latitude, longitude)
        loop Conservative read retry for transient failures
            IngestionClient->>Ingestion: GET /internal/weather/current<br/>x-ingestion-token
        end
        Ingestion->>OWM: getCurrentWeather(location)
        OWM-->>Ingestion: normalized reading
        Ingestion-->>IngestionClient: current weather DTO
        IngestionClient-->>Service: reading
        Service-->>Controller: station + temperature + observedAt + fetchedAt
        Controller-->>Client: 200 CurrentTemperatureReport
    end

    Note over IngestionClient,Ingestion: Timeout, bulkhead, circuit breaker and max-one retry protect this synchronous boundary.
    Note over Ingestion,OWM: OWM typed failures map to 502/503/504; no stale cache is returned for synchronous reads.
